     "explanation": "She clearly has agency thinking - the belief she can generate effort - but lacks pathways thinking, the ability to generate an alternate route when the first one is blocked. Snyder's theory holds that both components are required together; agency without pathways produces exactly this pattern, determined effort that collapses the moment a single plan fails because no backup route exists.",
